  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai pumpkin curry serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes. The main vegetables are butternut squash or pumpkin, cut into 3 cm cubes (no slug, use butternut squash or any dense-fleshed pumpkin), simmered until tender in a red curry sauce made with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "coconut milk",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coconut-milk"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kaffir lime leaves",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kaffir-lime-leaves"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Firm tofu",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tofu-firm"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " adds body and protein."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Check that your red curry paste is vegan. Many shop-bought versions contain shrimp paste. Look for a paste labelled vegan or make your own without shrimp paste."
          }
        ]
      },
